      "title": "gsm_a_rr: add NRI decoding when pool is used",
      "message": "gsm_a_rr: add NRI decoding when pool is used\n\nProtocol BSSGP has option in GUI to enable decoding NRI when SGSN pool\nis used. But this configuration option is not used in code.\n\nI have marked this option as obsolete and add new single option to protocol dissector gsm_a_rr\nwhere TLLI is decoded and added code for processing NRI.\n",
      "author_name": "Michail Koreshkov",
      "author_email": "drkor@bk.ru",
      "authored_date": "2021-08-17T21:00:30.000+03:00",
      "committer_name": "Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
